## Getting started

Requires Node.js <%- pkg.engines.node %> and <%- pm %> <%- pkg.devEngines.packageManager.version %>.
Use <%- pm %> to install dependencies and run scripts; the app requires this package manager.

```sh
<%- pm %> install
cp .env.example .env
<%- command('dev') %>
```

Open <http://localhost:3000/>. Change `PORT` in `.env` to use another port.
The development server restarts when the app or `.env` changes.
<% if (options.logger === 'pino') { -%>
Requests use pino JSON logging, made readable with pino-pretty in development.
Use `req.log` for your own application logs.
<% } else { -%>
Requests are logged with morgan.
<% } -%>

